      "locator": "::node-46",
      "line": 43,
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "source_text": "Begin with the three readiness checks. If a check is difficult, use its review link and worked answer, then try again without looking. After each section, try its Easy problem, use the separate hint if needed, and continue to Medium once you can explain the steps. Hard problems combine ideas or expose a common mistake. Keep the answers closed on your first attempt.",
